    "q1_question": "How do I register for a TTA E-Bank account?",
    "q1_answer": "You can register by downloading the TTA E-Bank app, selecting 'Sign Up' and following the instructions. You'll need to provide personal information, Citizen ID number, and complete eKYC verification.",
    "q2_question": "I forgot my password, what should I do?",
    "q2_answer": "On the login screen, select 'Forgot Password', enter your registered email or phone number. You will receive an OTP code to reset your password.",
    "q2a_question": "How do I change my password?",
    "q2a_answer": "Go to Settings > Privacy > Change Password. Enter your current password, then enter your new password and confirm it. Password must be at least 8 characters long, including uppercase, lowercase, numbers, and special characters.",
    "q3_question": "Are there any fees for internal transfers?",
    "q3_answer": "Internal transfers within the TTA E-Bank system are completely free and processed instantly. Please note that you must set up your PIN and EKYC before making any transactions.",
    "q4_question": "What is the maximum transfer limit?",
    "q4_answer": "Transfer limits depend on your settings. You can adjust your daily limit and single transaction limit at Card > Manage Limits.",
    "q5_question": "How do I set up a PIN code?",
    "q5_answer": "Go to Settings > Security > PIN, toggle the switch and follow the instructions to create a 4-digit PIN. The PIN will be required for important transactions.",
    "q6_question": "Can I change my transaction limits?",
    "q6_answer": "Yes, go to Card > Manage Limits to adjust your daily limit and single transaction limit as needed, within the system's allowed range.",
    "q6a_question": "What is eKYC and why do I need to verify?",
    "q6a_answer": "eKYC (Electronic Know Your Customer) is an electronic identity verification process. You need to complete eKYC to unlock full transaction features and increase your transfer limits. Go to Settings > Biometric to perform verification.",
    "q7_question": "How do I temporarily lock my card?",
    "q7_answer": "Go to the Card screen, tap the three-dot menu in the top right corner, select 'Lock Card'. You can unlock it anytime by selecting 'Unlock Card'."
